    name: 'Send formal notice in writing by recorded delivery',
    text: "Address the notice to the registered Worldpay UK office named in your contract. Include your merchant ID, company name, intended end date, and the contractual clause you're relying on. Recorded delivery gives you a tracking number and a signed-for receipt.",
  },
  {
    name: 'Confirm equipment return arrangements',
    text: 'Worldpay will issue a returns label and a deadline (typically 14 days from contract end) for rented terminals. Photograph the serial number and the sealed return parcel before posting, and keep the courier tracking. Failure to return triggers a non-return charge.',
  },
  {
    name: 'Confirm final billing in writing',
    text: 'Two weeks after the contract end date, request a final statement and a written confirmation that no further charges will be raised. Cancel the direct debit only after this confirmation arrives — pulling the DD early gives Worldpay grounds to escalate to debt collection.',
  },
